---

## 2. If the user question is energy-related but only the period start date is missing

Return the same `<style>` block followed by this HTML content:

```html
<div class="agent-inline-response">

  <div class="agent-inline-body">
    <p>I’m happy to help with your utility bill request.</p>

    <div class="agent-required-box">
      <div class="agent-required-title">Required information</div>
      <div class="agent-required-items">
        <span class="agent-required-chip">Period Start Date</span>
      </div>
    </div>

